<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>Bazar Naka – Online Supermarket</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/stylesheets/style.css" />
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/stylesheets/details.css" />
    <link rel="icon" href="/images/lg.png" type="image/x-icon" />
  </head>
  <body>
    <section class="project-detail">
      <div class="container">
        <a href="/" class="back-link">← Back to Home</a>
        <h1>Bazar Naka – Online Supermarket</h1>

        <img src="/images/leader.png" alt="Bazar Naka" class="project-banner" />

        <p class="description">
          <strong>Bazar Naka</strong> is a complete online supermarket platform
          allowing users to explore a large selection of grocery and household
          products, add items to their cart, and place orders easily from the
          comfort of their home.
        </p>

        <h2>Main Features:</h2>
        <ul class="features">
          <li>🛒 Organized product categories and listings</li>
          <li>📝 Simple and efficient order form</li>
          <li>📦 Order tracking and management system</li>
          <li>📱 Mobile-responsive and user-friendly design</li>
          <li>🔎 Instant search and filter functionality</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>Technologies Used:</h2>
        <ul class="tech-stack">
          <li>💎 Ruby on Rails</li>
          <li>🧩 HTML & CSS</li>
          <li>🗃️ PostgreSQL</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>Challenges Faced:</h2>
        <ul class="challenges">
          <li>🔄 Managing a real-time dynamic cart using React state hooks.</li>
          <li>📱 Ensuring full responsiveness across all screen sizes.</li>
          <li>🚀 Optimizing load times for pages with many product images.</li>
          <li>
            🔐 Handling user input and order validation without a backend.
          </li>
        </ul>

        <h2>Solutions Implemented:</h2>
        <ul class="solutions">
          <li>
            ✅ Used <strong>useState</strong> and <strong>useEffect</strong> to
            manage cart and order state effectively.
          </li>
          <li>✅ Created modular components to streamline the UI and logic.</li>
          <li>
            ✅ Added lazy loading and asset compression to improve performance.
          </li>
          <li>✅ Built lightweight form validation and notification system.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>Conclusion:</h2>
        <p>
          Bazar Naka showcases my ability to design, develop, and optimize a
          web-based application tailored to real-world needs. It highlights my
          strengths in frontend technologies and user-centered design.
        </p>

        <div class="links">
          <a href="https://bazarnaka.onrender.com/" target="_blank"
            >🌐 View Demo</a
          >
          <a href="https://github.com/Hassyunity/bazar_naka" target="_blank"
            >🔗 View Code</a
          >
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </body>
</html>
